                                                "sense_id": "55dc069b-bff9-3275-b70b-cb9ea88d4176",
                                                "text": "The Mulls have been excited also by another occurrence […] affecting rather the trading than fashionable world."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "11c91563-a26b-4fa2-b105-ad65d74f382a",
                                                "sense_id": "55dc069b-bff9-3275-b70b-cb9ea88d4176",
                                                "text": "[…] but the glorious days, when \"Qui-hyes\" and \"Mulls\" used to be pitted against each other for first spear, have vanished, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "08c6e827-ea26-4dc3-b5f6-0f5f30890fa5",
                                                "sense_id": "55dc069b-bff9-3275-b70b-cb9ea88d4176",
                                                "text": "[R]esidents of Bengal, Bombay, and Madras are, in Eastern parlance, designated 'Qui Hies,' 'Ducks,' and 'Mulls.'"
                                            }
